STILLWING — third-party assets used in this film

Fonts
Archivo, IBM Plex Mono — SIL Open Font License 1.1 (from studio/kit/fonts)

Voice
Kokoro-82M text-to-speech (Apache 2.0), voice bm_george, via kokoro-onnx

Music and sound
Samples played through the Lemo-Opuscar sampler: marimba, vibraphone (bowed), glockenspiel, hi-hat (VCSL, CC0 1.0); glass harp,
electric bass (FreePats, CC0 1.0); claves (VSCO 2 CE, CC0 1.0). Kick, foley and room tone synthesised in audio/mix.py.

Engine and tools
Lemo-Opuscar library (MIT) by Lemomo — Exploded Teardown style (engine adapted to 1080×1920 with English captions as
studio/kits/exploded-teardown/teardown.js), three.js (MIT), core render tools

No photographs, logos, stock footage or AI-generated video are used: everything is drawn in code. The lifter cell and the plane
silhouette are generic models, not CAD of any real craft.
